# Build & commit workflow

## Gulp tasks

| Task | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `setup-hooks` | Copy `pre-commit` into `.git/hooks/` (executable); remove retired `post-commit` |
| `bump-asset-version` | Bump `?v=` timestamp in all HTML; write `assets/asset-version.txt` |
| `bump-asset-version-if-changed` | Bump only if `assets/js/scripts.js` or `assets/css/main.css` changed |
| `precommit` | Used by git hook: bump `?v=` when JS/CSS changed + version patch |
| `serve` (default) | BrowserSync on `./`, watches HTML/CSS/JS; `no-store` for HTML/JS/CSS |
| `update-html` | Sync HTML `?v=` to value in `assets/asset-version.txt` (no bump) |

## Commit hooks

`pre-commit` → runs `yarn precommit` (`gulp precommit`), then `git add .` if hook output changed:
1. If neither `assets/js/scripts.js` nor `assets/css/main.css` has git changes → skip bump
2. Otherwise run `bump-asset-version` (new `?v=` timestamp in all HTML + `assets/asset-version.txt`)
3. `yarn version patch -i` (once, if either asset changed)
4. Stage hook output into the commit

## Yarn scripts

| Script | Command |
|--------|---------|
| `start` | `npx gulp` (BrowserSync on port 3000) |
| `setup-hooks` | Install git hooks from repo root |
| `ci` | `yarn install --immutable` (then `postci` runs `yarn start`) |
| `verify` | `yarn install --immutable --check-cache` |
| `precommit` | `gulp precommit` |
| `build:error-pages` | `node scripts/build-error-pages.js` — rebuild `404.html`, `403.html`, `500.html` from `contact.html` chrome |
| `test:e2e` | `playwright test` (local: requires `yarn start` on port 3000) |
| `test:e2e:headed` | Headed Edge run |
| `test:e2e:ui` | Playwright UI mode |
| `pretest:e2e` | Fails fast if nothing is listening on http://127.0.0.1:3000 |

**Package manager:** Yarn 4.17 (`packageManager` field). npm blocked via `engine-strict`.

## Playwright

- Config: `playwright.config.js` — Edge channel, `testDir: ./tests`
- CI: starts BrowserSync on port 3000 via `webServer`
- Local: run `yarn start` first, then `yarn test:e2e`
- **142 tests** in 13 spec files + `tests/helpers/site.js` — titles use UAT v2.0 IDs (`NAV-01`, `PT-17`, etc.)
- Specs: `about`, `activities`, `contact-form`, `cookie-consent`, `errors`, `homepage`, `madrasa`, `mobile-nav`, `prayer-times`, `projects`, `responsive`, `seo`, `site-chrome`

## Rules for agents

- **Never** manually edit `package.json` version
- **Never** manually edit `?v=` in HTML `<script>` / `<link>` tags
- **Never** manually bump `assets/asset-version.txt`
- After JS/CSS changes, verify with `yarn start` before committing
- Use `yarn ci` (`yarn install --immutable`) in CI; `yarn verify` checks install integrity

## Adding dependencies

Dev-only tooling belongs in `devDependencies`. Pin exact versions (`save-exact=true` in `.npmrc`).
